        "content": "<p>fitzgen opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15173\">PR #15173</a> from <code>fitzgen:enclosing-component-in-core-translation</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Getting the handle-table slots array's base pointer requires the component's own<br>\noffsets rather than just the pointer size, but we do the inline translation of<br>\nFACT trampolines in a <code>FuncEnvironment</code> that only has an <code>AliasRegions&lt;VMOffsets&gt;</code>.<br>\nTherefore, core Wasm translation now has an <code>Option&lt;AliasRegions&lt;VMComponentOffsets&gt;&gt;</code><br>\nfor core modules compiled as part of a component.</p>\n<p>Depends on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15171\">https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15171</a></p>\n</blockquote>",
