    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> cfallin created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15173#discussion_r4496636436\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It's too bad that the macro-expander doesn't do tail recursion...? (Or are we not tail-recursive in this macro and if so, is there a way we could refactor so we are?)</p>\n</blockquote>",
