        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1793994505
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> fitzgen created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15173#discussion_r4496870482\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I do believe that tail recursion is more efficient for <code>rustc</code> but since it doesn't have loops, the recursion limit is really just fuel for macro expansion in general.</p>\n</blockquote>",
